  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "馬モチーフのエグザビークル、「ホースメカ」にホワイトが新たに登場！",
      "en": "A new white version of the \"Horse Mecha\", a horse-themed vehicle, is now available!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部から脚先まで各関節がフレキシブルに可動。",
      "en": "• Each joint from the head to the legs can move flexibly."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 尻尾のパーツは折りたたみ式。",
      "en": "• The tail parts are foldable."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りの各種機体を騎乗させることが可能。",
      "en": "• It is possible to ride various aircraft sold separately."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「カスタマイズマテリアル（パイプパーツ/マルチジョイント）」など別売りのアイテムに付属するジョイントパーツを使用することで、騎乗する機体を固定しディスプレイが可能。",
      "en": "• By using joint parts that come with separately sold items such as \"Customized Materials (Pipe Parts/Multi-Joint)\", you can fix and display the aircraft you are riding."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「30MM 1/144 EXM-H15C アチェルビー (TYPE-C)」などの別売りの機体とカスタマイズ用のジョイントパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Includes separately sold aircraft such as \"30MM 1/144 EXM-H15C Achelby (TYPE-C)\" and joint parts for customization."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 脚パーツは別売り機体の脚パーツとしても使用できる。",
      "en": "• The leg parts can also be used as leg parts for the aircraft sold separately."
    }
  ],
